      "summary": "GoogleTest 测试夹具类，负责测试目录创建/清理、日志文件内容读取、配置文件生成等测试辅助功能。SetUp 创建临时目录，TearDown 调用 Logger::Uninit 并清理文件。",
      "tags": ["test", "test-fixture", "google-test"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:common/log/logger_impl.cc:Init",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "Init(config_file)",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger_impl.cc",
      "lineRange": [75, 105],
      "summary": "配置文件式初始化入口。解析 JSON 配置后调用参数式 Init，然后设置额外的配置项（flush 级别、模式、缓冲区大小），并通过环境变量覆盖控制台/文件日志级别。最后启动后台配置热重载监控线程。",
      "tags": ["initialization", "config", "entry-point"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:common/log/logger_impl.cc:Init_params",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "Init(params)",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger_impl.cc",
      "lineRange": [112, 204],
      "summary": "参数式初始化，是日志系统的核心构建函数。根据 LoggerType 创建对应的 spdlog sink（控制台/文件/双输出），配置异步模式（线程池 + overrun_oldest 策略）或同步模式，注册 spdlog 全局 logger。支持环境变量覆盖日志级别。",
      "tags": ["initialization", "spdlog-wrapper", "core-logic"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:common/log/logger_impl.cc:LoggerConfigChecker",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "LoggerConfigChecker",
      "filePath": "common/log/logger_impl.cc",
      "lineRange": [45, 66],
      "summary": "后台配置热重载监控线程。每秒检查配置文件的修改时间，当检测到变更时重新解析配置并应用（仅更新 flush 级别和控制台/文件日志级别）。忽略文件系统错误，持续运行直到 is_running_ 为 false。",
      "tags": ["background-thread", "config-hot-reload", "file-monitor"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:common/log/logger_impl.cc:Uninit",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "Uninit",
